---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'
---

<BaseLayout>
	<main class="app-container pt-36">
		<h1 class="text-6xl pb-2 font-bold">About Me</h1>
	</main>
	<section class="app-container py-12 mb-8">
		<div
			class="prose prose-neutral prose-lg md:prose-xl dark:prose-invert prose-img:rounded-xl prose-figure:text-center prose-img:mx-auto"
		>
			<p>
				👋 Hi, I'm <strong>Greivin Cruz Ríos</strong>, a passionate JavaScript FullStack Developer and AI Enthusiast based in San José, Costa Rica. I specialize in building modern web applications and digital growth strategies that help businesses thrive in the digital era.
			</p>
			
			<h2>Professional Experience</h2>
			<p>
				I currently work with <strong>Progranet & Bemantis Technologies of Costa Rica</strong>, where I combine my technical expertise with digital marketing management. At Bemantis, I lead the digital growth strategies, helping clients improve their online presence through data-driven decisions, SEO optimization, and comprehensive digital roadmaps.
			</p>
			
			<h2>Technical Expertise</h2>
			<p>
				As a FullStack Developer, I have extensive experience with:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Frontend:</strong> JavaScript (ES6+), React.js, Vue.js, Angular, HTML5 & CSS3</li>
				<li><strong>Backend:</strong> Node.js, .NET Core, PHP 7.x (Laravel/Symfony), Python</li>
				<li><strong>Databases:</strong> MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, MSSQL</li>
				<li><strong>Current Focus:</strong> Advanced AI/ML concepts, Laravel 11, Symfony framework</li>
			</ul>
			
			<h2>Digital Marketing & Growth</h2>
			<p>
				Beyond development, I'm the mind behind digital growth strategies at Bemantis. With deep knowledge in SEO, analytics, and user behavior, I help clients get found online and stay ahead of the competition. I focus on data-driven decisions, intelligent keyword selection, and building strategies that actually work.
			</p>
			
			<h2>Projects & Contributions</h2>
			<p>
				I maintain an active presence on <a href="https://github.com/gcruzrios" target="_blank">GitHub</a> with 146+ public repositories, including projects in Drupal, Laravel, hybrid mobile applications, and more. I'm always interested in collaborating on Node.js projects and exploring new technologies.
			</p>
			
			<h2>Let's Connect</h2>
			<p>
				I'm passionate about technology and always eager to connect with fellow developers and businesses looking to transform their digital presence. Whether you need a custom web application, digital marketing strategy, or want to collaborate on exciting projects, I'm here to help.
			</p>
			
			<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-8">
				<a href="mailto:gcruzr@gmail.com" class="btn-primary" target="_blank">
					<Icon height={20} name="mdi:email" />
					Email Me
				</a>
				<a href="https://github.com/gcruzrios" class="btn-secondary" target="_blank">
					<Icon height={20} name="mdi:github" />
					GitHub
				</a>
				<a href="https://x.com/gcruzrios" class="btn-secondary" target="_blank">
					<Icon height={20} name="mdi:twitter" />
					X / Twitter
				</a>
				<a href="http://www.greiv.in" class="btn-secondary" target="_blank">
					<Icon height={20} name="mdi:web" />
					Website
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
